    // Integer-division thresholds: bins whose post residual lands in a "dead zone"
    // (too small for typical items but too large to be free) are penalized.
    // Dead zones: residual in (0, 10) exclusive of 0 -> near-perfect fit (good);
    // residual in [10, 20) -> awkward; residual >= 20 usable.
    if post_residual > 0 && post_residual < 10 {
